\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Lord of heaven and earth and sea,
\par To Thee all praise and glory be;
\par How shall we show our love to Thee,
\par Who givest all?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The golden sunshine, vernal air,
\par Sweet flowers and fruits Thy love declare;
\par Where harvests ripen, Thou art there.
\par Who givest all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. For peaceful homes and healthful days,
\par For all the blessings earth displays,
\par We owe Thee thankfulness and praise,
\par Who givest all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thou didst not spare Thine only Son,
\par But gav'st Him for a world undone,
\par And freely with that blessed One
\par Thou givest all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thou giv'st the Spirit's blessed dower,
\par Spirit of life, and love, and power,
\par And dost His sevenfold graces shower
\par Upon us all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. For souls redeemed, for sins forgiven,
\par For means of grace and hopes of heaven,
\par Father, all praise to Thee be given,
\par Who givest all.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

